  "task": "FIND: the class name `OldName` (App\\OldName)\nREPLACE: `NewName`\nSCOPE: src/\nEXCLUSIONS: default\nMATCH RULE: the identifier `OldName` as a whole word in code (use statements, new, extends). String literals and comments do NOT count; skip and report them. Dynamically built names must be skipped and reported.",
